## Version Floors

`dep:` and weak `dep?/feat`: 1.60. Workspace inheritance: 1.64. `[lints]`: 1.74.
Optional `package.version`: 1.75. `resolver = "3"` and MSRV-aware resolution:
1.84. A workspace whose `rust-version` is older cannot use what came after it.
